src/staking/PendlePT_sUSDe.sol:_executeInstantRedemption:30|class=C15|Medium|The sUSDe→sDAI leg is force-routed through a hardcoded Curve pool with limit: 0 and deadline: block.timestamp and cannot be steered by params, so whenever redeemData is supplied by someone other than the position owner (approved spender / keeper / automated redemption) the attacker sets the only real guard params.minPurchaseAmount to 0 and sandwiches that one known pool, extracting the victim's redemption proceeds.|src/staking/PendlePT_sUSDe.sol
